Generative AI used: chatgpt
Prompts: how to convert parameter -i to system clock 
Summary: AI was used to help understand how -i parameter could be converted
from a fractional number of seconds into seconds and nanoseconds for comparison
with the system clock.


Generative AI used : chatgpt
Prompts: How to implement and update the process table.
Summary: used AI to help understand how to store worker info in the
process table, including the PID, start time, ending time, and occupied
status.


Generative AI used : chatgpt
Prompts: How to print the process table every half second of simulated time
Summary: AI was used to help understand how to use the simulated system clock to
print the process table every 0.5 simulated seconds.


